      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Copy over InternetMediateTYpes:",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "attrs" : {
                        "id" : "1f61b",
                        "shortName" : ":stuck_out_tongue:",
                        "text" : "😛"
                     },
                     "type" : "emoji"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "redefinedInternetMediaType to InternetMediaTypeRegistry",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Missing most of the unix impl",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "No safety/checking what oses (linux ./ att, bsd) etc have that database in that format.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Support abstraction, so can have differnt virtual impls - including one with hardwired data (maybe we even include/compile the data from a copy of the internet-based static files0.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Need a way to extend the db dynamically at runtime - copy and add to it.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
